    description: "When Claude Code crashes, the stored PID in AUTONOMOUS_MODE.txt becomes stale. The stop hook treated the new session as interactive and approved immediately, bypassing all autonomous mode blocking. Fix: check if stored PID is alive before deciding — if dead, re-claim ownership. Also fixed 3 pre-existing test issues and added 2 new tests. All changed files are governance files requiring human approval."  # ddca
